==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
Literally “for what”, from {{term|za||for|lang=sh}} + {{term|što|štȍ|what|lang=sh}}. For the conjunction compare {{term|zato što|lang=sh}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/zâʃto/|lang=sh}}
* {{hyphenation|za|što}}

===Adverb===
{{sh-adverb|head=zȁšto|r|зашто|за̏што}}

# [[why]], [[what for]]
#: ''zašto ne?'' — why not?
#: ''zašto to?'' — why so? why is that?

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|why}} {{l|sh|što|štȍ}}

===Conjunction===
{{sh-conjunction|head=zȁšto|r|зашто|за̏што}}

# {{archaic|lang=sh}} [[because]]

====Synonyms====
